                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is pretty much dead, and it looks like there won't be any more updates. It's a shame, because I really liked it when it was first released.\nWhy I don't recommend it:\n- Poor balance: The AI becomes too strong too quickly, making progression frustrating.\n- Way too slow: Sometimes, there's simply nothing to do but wait. There's no way to speed up time, which makes these moments even more tedious.\n- Repetitive gameplay: After a while, everything starts to feel the same.\n- Boring quests: The quests lack variety and aren't particularly engaging.\n- Forgettable characters: The characters have little to no personality. They all feel too similar, making it hard to get attached to any of them.\nIt's a shame, because the game had potential, and I genuinely enjoyed it at first. Unfortunately, the repetitive gameplay, poor pacing, and lack of character depth eventually ruined the experience for me. With no more updates expected, I don't see these issues getting fixed.",
